{"seq":2,"slug":"evidence-link-investigate","title":"证据挂链与调查作业","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/case-investigation-sla/evidence-link-investigate","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"证据挂链与调查作业\">证据挂链与调查作业</h1><p>一笔短款被查了两周最后不了了之，月末复盘时最尴尬的问题不是&quot;为什么没查出来&quot;，而是&quot;当时到底看过什么&quot;。如果看了银行流水、渠道结算通知、支付网关回调三份材料却只在系统里写了一行&quot;经查无异常&quot;，那么这两周的工作等于没有发生过——下一个人接手要从零开始，审计也无法判断这个结论是否站得住。调查工单的核心资产不是结论，是<strong>结论所依赖的证据链</strong>：哪些原始材料被看过、它们当时是什么样、是谁在什么时间把它们与这张工单关联起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-证据的三类与不可变要求\">核心概念：证据的三类与不可变要求</h2><p>差异调查用到的证据按来源分三类，它们的获取方式、可信度和保存要求都不同：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;调查工单&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;第一类:双方账务凭证&lt;br/&gt;银行对账单/渠道结算文件&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;第二类:业务侧凭证&lt;br/&gt;支付流水/退款单/订单快照&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;第三类:外部沟通&lt;br/&gt;渠道回函/工单往来/邮件&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;以引用方式挂链&lt;br/&gt;存摘要 + 定位键&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;追加写 evidence_link&lt;br/&gt;不可修改&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;调查时间线&lt;br/&gt;只追加&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;结论 + 核销依据&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"调查工单\"] --&gt; B[\"第一类:双方账务凭证&lt;br/&gt;银行对账单/渠道结算文件\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"第二类:业务侧凭证&lt;br/&gt;支付流水/退款单/订单快照\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"第三类:外部沟通&lt;br/&gt;渠道回函/工单往来/邮件\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"以引用方式挂链&lt;br/&gt;存摘要 + 定位键\"]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[\"追加写 evidence_link&lt;br/&gt;不可修改\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"调查时间线&lt;br/&gt;只追加\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"结论 + 核销依据\"]</pre><p>三类证据有一个共同要求：<strong>挂链是追加写的，不是可覆盖的</strong>。原因很实际——如果证据引用可以被修改，那么&quot;某人删掉了对自己不利的那条银行流水&quot;这种事就无法被发现，而这类事情一旦发生过一次，整个系统的可信度就没了。</p>\n<p>追加写事件日志（event sourcing）提供了这个性质的技术形态：状态变化被记录为不可变的事件序列，任何时刻的状态都可以通过重放事件重建，而完整的事件历史本身就是一个可靠的审计日志（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/event-sourcing.html\">Event sourcing</a>）。工单的证据链正是这样一条事件流：<code>evidence_linked</code>、<code>evidence_viewed</code>、<code>finding_recorded</code>、<code>case_reassigned</code> 都是事件，而不是可变字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证据挂链的数据设计\">证据挂链的数据设计</h2><h3 id=\"引用而非复制\">引用而非复制</h3><p>证据挂链最容易被做错的一点是&quot;把证据内容复制进工单表&quot;。复制会带来三个问题：存储膨胀（一份结算文件被挂到 400 张工单上）、一致性破坏（原始文件更新了，工单里的副本还是旧的）、以及<strong>审计断链</strong>（副本无法证明与原始文件相同）。</p>\n<p>正确做法是存引用加摘要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;link_id&quot;: &quot;EVL-2026-09-0022190&quot;,&#10;  &quot;case_id&quot;: &quot;CS-2026-09-004312&quot;,&#10;  &quot;evidence&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;source_type&quot;: &quot;channel_settlement_file&quot;,&#10;    &quot;source_uri&quot;: &quot;s3://recon-archive/CH_CARD_ACQ/2026-09-25/SETTLE_20260925_001.xml&quot;,&#10;    &quot;locator&quot;: { &quot;entry_ref&quot;: &quot;ENT-000183442&quot;, &quot;page&quot;: 41 },&#10;    &quot;content_digest&quot;: &quot;sha256:9f2c...b7e1&quot;,&#10;    &quot;retained_until&quot;: &quot;2033-09-25&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;linked_by&quot;: &quot;u_7f3a91c2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;linked_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T07:02:41Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;purpose&quot;: &quot;证明该笔清算金额与渠道文件第 183442 行一致&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"link_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EVL-2026-09-0022190\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"case_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CS-2026-09-004312\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"channel_settlement_file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source_uri\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"s3://recon-archive/CH_CARD_ACQ/2026-09-25/SETTLE_20260925_001.xml\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"locator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"entry_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ENT-000183442\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"page\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"content_digest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:9f2c...b7e1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"retained_until\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2033-09-25\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"linked_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_7f3a91c2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"linked_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T07:02:41Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"purpose\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"证明该笔清算金额与渠道文件第 183442 行一致\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>content_digest</code> 是关键字段：它让&quot;工单里引用的这份证据&quot;与&quot;归档里的原始文件&quot;可以通过摘要校验建立关系。<code>locator</code> 则保证可复核——审核人不需要打开整个文件，直接定位到那一行。<code>retained_until</code> 让证据的保留期限与归档策略对齐，避免工单还在、证据已过期删除。</p>\n<h3 id=\"摘要链让历史可检测篡改\">摘要链让历史可检测篡改</h3><p>仅有单条摘要还不够。如果把每条证据摘要按时间顺序链起来——每条新记录的摘要包含前一条的摘要——就得到了一个可检测篡改的序列。这是哈希链的基本机制：每个块包含前一个块的密码学哈希，修改任何早期记录都会改变其哈希，从而与下一个块中存储的哈希不匹配，导致该链接及之后所有链接失效（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blockchain\">Blockchain</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>link</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mtext>payload</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>link</mtext><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{link}_n = H\\left(\\text{payload}_n \\;\\|\\; \\text{link}_{n-1}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">link</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payload</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">link</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上不需要区块链的全部机制（没有多方共识需求），只需要这个链式摘要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE case_evidence_link (&#10;  link_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_id        BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  source_type    TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  source_uri     TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  locator        JSONB       NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;,&#10;  content_digest TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  linked_by      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  linked_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  prev_link_hash TEXT,&#10;  link_hash      TEXT        NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION append_evidence_link(&#10;  p_case_id BIGINT, p_source_uri TEXT, p_digest TEXT, p_by TEXT&#10;) RETURNS TEXT LANGUAGE plpgsql AS $$&#10;DECLARE v_prev TEXT; v_hash TEXT;&#10;BEGIN&#10;  PERFORM pg_advisory_xact_lock(p_case_id);&#10;  SELECT link_hash INTO v_prev FROM case_evidence_link&#10;   WHERE case_id = p_case_id ORDER BY link_id DESC LIMIT 1;&#10;  v_hash := encode(digest(coalesce(v_prev,&#39;&#39;) || p_source_uri || p_digest, &#39;sha256&#39;), &#39;hex&#39;);&#10;  INSERT INTO case_evidence_link (case_id, source_type, source_uri,&#10;         content_digest, linked_by, prev_link_hash, link_hash)&#10;  VALUES (p_case_id, &#39;channel_settlement_file&#39;, p_source_uri, p_digest, p_by, v_prev, v_hash);&#10;  RETURN v_hash;&#10;END $$;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> case_evidence_link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  link_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_uri     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  locator        JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  content_digest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  linked_by      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  linked_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prev_link_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  link_hash      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append_evidence_link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p_case_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_source_uri </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_digest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_by </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plpgsql </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECLARE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; v_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  PERFORM pg_advisory_xact_lock(p_case_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> link_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_evidence_link</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_case_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> link_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_hash :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encode(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">digest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_prev,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_source_uri </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_digest, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sha256'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hex'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_evidence_link (case_id, source_type, source_uri,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         content_digest, linked_by, prev_link_hash, link_hash)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (p_case_id, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'channel_settlement_file'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_source_uri, p_digest, p_by, v_prev, v_hash);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  RETURN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_hash;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>pg_advisory_xact_lock(p_case_id)</code> 让同一工单的追加串行化，避免并发追加导致两条记录拿到同一个 <code>prev_link_hash</code> 从而链分叉。这是<strong>同一聚合根写入必须串行</strong>这一约束在证据链上的具体体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调查作业的状态机与作业规范\">调查作业的状态机与作业规范</h2><h3 id=\"工单状态机\">工单状态机</h3><p>调查不是一个自由文本过程，它有明确的状态与允许的转移：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>允许转移</th>\n<th>时钟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>assigned</code></td>\n<td>已分派未开始</td>\n<td>→ <code>investigating</code>、→ <code>reassigned</code></td>\n<td>走</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>investigating</code></td>\n<td>调查中</td>\n<td>→ <code>pending_external</code>、→ <code>resolved</code>、→ <code>escalated</code></td>\n<td>走</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pending_external</code></td>\n<td>等待渠道/银行回复</td>\n<td>→ <code>investigating</code>、→ <code>escalated</code></td>\n<td><strong>暂停</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>escalated</code></td>\n<td>已升级</td>\n<td>→ <code>investigating</code>、→ <code>resolved</code></td>\n<td>走</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resolved</code></td>\n<td>有结论待核销</td>\n<td>→ <code>writeoff_pending</code>、→ <code>investigating</code></td>\n<td>走</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>writeoff_pending</code></td>\n<td>待审批核销</td>\n<td>→ <code>closed</code>、→ <code>reopened</code></td>\n<td>走</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>closed</code></td>\n<td>已关闭</td>\n<td>→ <code>reopened</code>（限期内）</td>\n<td>停</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>pending_external</code> 是唯一暂停时钟的状态，理由是这时的等待属于我方不可控的外部依赖，与 <a href=\"exception-case-assign\">例外工单分派与路由</a> 里&quot;容量不足不得暂停时钟&quot;的约定形成对照。但暂停必须有上限——见下一节。</p>\n<h3 id=\"调查作业清单\">调查作业清单</h3><p>一个可复用的调查清单把&quot;老手知道要查什么&quot;变成&quot;新人也不会漏&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>产出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>确认差异方向与金额精度（最小货币单位）</td>\n<td>差异性质确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>定位渠道结算文件中对应行</td>\n<td>第一类证据挂链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>回溯业务侧流水，找对应订单与支付尝试</td>\n<td>第二类证据挂链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>检查是否有配对候选未被采纳</td>\n<td>引用建议引擎结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>若涉外部，发起渠道查询并置 <code>pending_external</code></td>\n<td>第三类证据挂链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>记录 finding（结论 + 拟处置动作 + 依据证据 ID）</td>\n<td><code>resolved</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第 6 步的 finding 必须显式引用证据 ID，且<strong>不允许引用不存在的证据</strong>。这个约束在数据库层可以强制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE case_finding (&#10;  finding_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_id      BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  conclusion   TEXT   NOT NULL CHECK (conclusion IN&#10;                 (&#39;channel_error&#39;,&#39;our_error&#39;,&#39;timing&#39;,&#39;rate_diff&#39;,&#39;unresolved&#39;)),&#10;  proposed_action TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (proposed_action IN&#10;                 (&#39;writeoff&#39;,&#39;recover_from_channel&#39;,&#39;reclassify&#39;,&#39;escalate&#39;)),&#10;  evidence_ids BIGINT[] NOT NULL CHECK (cardinality(evidence_ids) &gt; 0),&#10;  recorded_by  TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  recorded_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;ALTER TABLE case_finding ADD CONSTRAINT finding_evidence_fk&#10;  FOREIGN KEY (evidence_ids) REFERENCES case_evidence_link (link_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> case_finding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  finding_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  conclusion   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (conclusion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'channel_error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'our_error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'timing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rate_diff'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unresolved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  proposed_action </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (proposed_action </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'writeoff'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'recover_from_channel'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reclassify'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'escalate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_ids </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cardinality(evidence_ids) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recorded_by  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recorded_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_finding </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ADD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> finding_evidence_fk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (evidence_ids) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_evidence_link (link_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>evidence_ids</code> 的 <code>cardinality &gt; 0</code> 约束是刻意的：<strong>没有引用证据的结论不允许落库</strong>。这一条把&quot;凭经验下结论&quot;从流程上排除掉了，也保证了核销审批环节永远有东西可审——这与 <a href=\"../suspense-writeoff/writeoff-approval-control\">核销审批与权限</a> 的审批矩阵直接衔接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暂停时钟的上限与外部跟进\">暂停时钟的上限与外部跟进</h2><p><code>pending_external</code> 可以让工单停在那里等待，但不能无限等。两个约束必须设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单次暂停有上限</strong>（例如 5 个工作日）：到期未收到外部回复就自动回到 <code>investigating</code> 并触发升级。这防止工单被&quot;等对方回复&quot;冻结。</li>\n<li><strong>累计暂停有上限</strong>（例如 15 个自然日）：超过后即便仍未收到回复也必须出结论，通常结论是 <code>unresolved</code> + 转入应收追偿或按容差核销。这是为了避免差异被无限期悬置在 <a href=\"../suspense-writeoff/suspense-account-posting\">挂账分录与过渡账户</a> 里，最终变成账龄看板上永远清不掉的一行。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>外部跟进的渠道查询本身是一个有状态的子流程，跨境场景里与银行的查询往来有标准报文形态（ISO 20022 的 camt.056 是 FI to FI 支付撤销请求，camt.029 是调查结果回复，二者构成&quot;发起查询—回复结论&quot;的一对）。系统不需要实现银行间报文，但<strong>工单的外部跟进记录应当保留与对方事件编号的对应关系</strong>，这样当渠道方事后追溯一笔查询时，双方能对上号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调查工单的核心资产是证据链，不是结论；没有证据引用的结论不允许落库（用 <code>cardinality &gt; 0</code> 的外键强制）。</li>\n<li>证据挂链存引用 + 摘要 + 定位键，不复制内容；<code>content_digest</code> 保证工单引用与归档原件可校验对应。</li>\n<li>用链式摘要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>link</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>payload</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mtext>link</mtext><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{link}_n = H(\\text{payload}_n \\| \\text{link}_{n-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">link</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payload</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">link</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 让历史可检测篡改，并发追加要用聚合根级锁串行化。</li>\n<li>状态机只有 <code>pending_external</code> 暂停时钟（等待外部不可控），但单次与累计暂停都要设上限。</li>\n<li>调查清单把老手经验固化为可复用步骤；外部跟进要保留与对方事件编号的对应，便于双方事后追溯。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>证据与结论齐备后，工单要按时限推进并升级——见 <a href=\"case-sla-escalation\">工单 SLA 与升级</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"证据挂链与调查作业","id":"证据挂链与调查作业"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：证据的三类与不可变要求","id":"核心概念-证据的三类与不可变要求"},{"level":2,"text":"证据挂链的数据设计","id":"证据挂链的数据设计"},{"level":3,"text":"引用而非复制","id":"引用而非复制"},{"level":3,"text":"摘要链让历史可检测篡改","id":"摘要链让历史可检测篡改"},{"level":2,"text":"调查作业的状态机与作业规范","id":"调查作业的状态机与作业规范"},{"level":3,"text":"工单状态机","id":"工单状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"调查作业清单","id":"调查作业清单"},{"level":2,"text":"暂停时钟的上限与外部跟进","id":"暂停时钟的上限与外部跟进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"例外工单分派与路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/case-investigation-sla/exception-case-assign"},"next":{"title":"工单 SLA 与升级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/case-investigation-sla/case-sla-escalation"}}